                "resource_change": "Agent successfully caught one large fish due to high luck, significantly impacting food resources positively (potential gain). The unique opportunity of unusually close fish is now gone. Previously depleted plant resources remain unchanged.",
                "environmental_shift": "Signs of struggle/splashing present near the flat rock at the stream's edge. The immediate wildlife dynamic has shifted due to the successful hunt. One fish removed from the local ecosystem."
