                    "satisfaction": "Experienced minor satisfaction from successfully finding and consuming food (berries).",
                    "caution": "Acknowledged the need for cautious movement due to low energy/health and awareness of potential risks (e.g., untreated water, although consumed)."
                },
                "lesson_learned": "Prioritizing immediate, easily solvable needs is an effective survival tactic. Careful observation of the immediate surroundings can yield necessary resources. Untreated resources like water might carry risks, impacting health later."
            },
