                "context": "Experiencing moderate hunger (4), low energy (5), and persistent illness (5) in a familiar woodland environment. Successfully addressed thirst and partial hunger.",
                "reflection": "Successfully addressed immediate needs (thirst, partial hunger) by utilizing readily available resources. The decision to prioritize water first, followed by cautious food intake, and then strategic rest on the rock proved effective for managing low energy and illness while conserving strength. Observing the environment continues to be key.",
                "emotional_response": {
