    "current_agent": null,
    "state_metadata": {
        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "The midday sun warms the large flat rock by the stream where you successfully landed a large fish. It lies fresh beside you, a significant bounty from your lucky catch. The immediate area is calm now, though the nearby squirrels and birds remain cautious after the disturbance. The stream flows clearly, and the woods stretch out around you. What do you want to do next?",
