            "terrain": "Mixed woodland bordering a clear, slow-moving stream. Agent is situated on a large, flat rock near the stream bank.",
            "temperature": 24,
            "weather": "Clear skies, warm sunshine, gentle breeze.",
            "food_availability": "One large, fresh fish (just caught). Nearby edible plants remain depleted. Root vegetables identifiable further inland. Squirrels are present but wary and distant.",
