                "resource_change": "One large fish successfully processed into prepared raw meat and inedible waste using a found sharp rock. Fish waste remains on the flat rock. Nearby plants still depleted. Water consumed (negligible impact).",
                "environmental_shift": "The flat rock area is now contaminated with fish waste, creating a strong scent attractant. Time has passed during the processing action. Temperature increased slightly."
            }
