                "resource_change": "Agent drank stream water (negligible impact). The prepared raw fish near the flat rock was left untouched and continues to spoil rapidly in the warmth. The flat rock remains contaminated with fish waste. Root vegetable location confirmed further inland.",
                "environmental_shift": "Agent relocated from the contaminated flat rock area to a resting spot under trees near the thicket, creating minor signs of passage. The fish waste site remains a focal point of decay and insect activity, with its scent spreading. Time has passed (drinking, moving, resting, observing)."
