                "lesson_learned": "Applying learned lessons is crucial for survival. Conserving energy through strategic rest when health is compromised is as vital as acquiring resources. Recognizing resource depletion and adjusting behavior (e.g., choosing rest over foraging depleted areas) is necessary for long-term sustainability. Self-awareness of physical state must guide actions."
