    "previous_agent": "ENVIRONMENT_SIMULATOR_DAY_START",
    "current_agent": null,
    "state_metadata": {
        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "Day 8 begins clear and warm. You are positioned near a thicket, away from the fly-infested, spoiled fish at the stream bank. Fresh water is readily available. You've spotted a small patch of ripe berries nearby. You also know root vegetables can be found further inland. What is your next action?",
