            "weather": "Clear skies, warm sunshine, gentle breeze carrying a faint, unpleasant scent from the stream bank.",
            "food_availability": "The fish left by the stream yesterday is now visibly spoiled, teeming with flies, and unsafe to eat. The fish waste on the nearby flat rock continues to decay significantly. Root vegetables are known to be available further inland, away from the stream. Good fortune (luck!) reveals a small patch of ripe, edible berries nearby your current resting spot.",
            "water_availability": "Abundant fresh water flows in the nearby stream.",
            "shelter_options": "Good concealment provided by the current position under trees near the dense thicket. The flat rock area near the stream remains contaminated and undesirable.",
