            "danger_level": "Medium. Primary danger remains potential illness from the contaminated rock/spoiled fish area. The lingering scent of decay, though slightly less intense than its peak, still poses a risk of attracting scavengers over time. Agent's low energy and illness increase vulnerability to any potential threat.",
