            "danger_level": "Low-Medium. The immediate risk from the contaminated zone and flies has been significantly reduced by relocation. However, the lingering scent of decay downstream still poses a background risk of attracting scavengers to the general area over time. Agent's weakened state remains a factor.",
            "notes_for_future": {
                "wildlife_alert": "Agent successfully relocated away from the primary contamination source. Flies remain concentrated downstream at the decay site. Local small wildlife (birds, squirrels) observed the agent's movement and are resettling cautiously near the new location. Background scavenger risk from the distant scent persists.",
