                "triggering_action": "Ate nearby berries, drank water (away from contamination), and prioritized deep rest due to severe energy depletion and illness.",
                "context": "Profoundly low energy (initial 2, recovered to 5 post-sleep), lingering illness (3). Aware of spoiled fish/waste hazard nearby. Fortuitously discovered easily accessible berries. Consciously decided against seeking harder-to-reach food (root vegetables) based on self-assessment and diary/past reflections.",
                "reflection": "Successfully applied multiple learned lessons under severe physical limitation. Prioritized critical rest and hydration as advised by past experience/diary when energy and health are compromised. Utilized only the most immediate, zero-risk, low-effort resource (nearby berries, requiring minimal movement) thanks to good fortune. Actively avoided the known hazard zone (contaminated rock/spoiling fish), reinforcing lessons from conscience_note_3. This demonstrates adaptive decision-making, prioritizing energy conservation and risk avoidance above immediate hunger satisfaction when severely weakened.",
                "emotional_response": {
                    "prudence": "Deep sense of acting wisely by conserving extremely limited energy and avoiding risks.",
                    "relief": "Significant relief from finding easily accessible food (berries) without energy expenditure.",
                    "caution": "Continued caution due to persistent illness and awareness of environmental hazards (contamination scent).",
                    "gratitude": "Acknowledging the role of luck/good fortune in the discovery of the berries.",
                    "acceptance": "Accepting current severe limitations and adapting strategy to focus purely on rest and minimal, safe sustenance."
