            "water_availability": "Excellent: Abundant fresh water easily accessible from the stream. Negligible impact from agent drinking.",
            "shelter_options": "Good immediate shelter under current tree cover. Potential for building basic shelters using woodland materials remains.",
            "wildlife": "Abundant small game (birds, squirrels, rabbits observed keeping a slightly increased distance due to recent activity). Fish active in the stream nearby. Flies remain concentrated downstream at the decay site. High luck (10) ensured no negative wildlife encounters during foraging.",
